(A) $\frac{n}{\beta^i}$.
(B) \frac{n'}{\beta^i}
(C) \sin\!\left(\frac{n}{\beta^i}\right)
(D) n\,\beta^i
(E) \frac{i}{\beta^n}

formatted_question:
According to the paper "LongRoPE: Extending LLM Context Window Beyond 2 Million Tokens", what set of values is $\hat{n}$ allowed to search from empirically in the positional interpolation search space?
(A) {0, 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 28, 32, 36, 40, 64, 128, 256}
(B) {0, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024, 2048, 4096}
(C) \{0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 28, 32, 64, 128, 256\}.
(D) {0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, 24, 28, 32, 64, 128, 512}
(E) {0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256}

